odotengine/godot/pull/109103, and https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107866.\r\n\r\nexposes \"export_gpu_instances\" option: https://docs.blender.org/api/4.0/bpy.ops.export_scene.html#bpy.ops.export_scene.gltf\r\n\r\nEnabling it will export instances and particle systems as GLTF's buffer/accessor data instead of numerous singular Mesh3D object. This does not include Geometry Nodes instancing.\r\n\r\nSmall project to test export with/without option: https://github.com/2frac/godot-gpu-instances-test\r\nIt also has small addon which actually creates and fills MultiMeshInstance3D using GLTFDocumentExtension. I might check if it is easy to add MultiMeshInstance3D creation to engine itself, but that seems like a separate task. ","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098219,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:editor","name":"topic:editor","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":12939969,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AxXLB","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/23","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/23","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/23/labels","number":23,"state":"closed","title":"4.6","description":"","creator":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gi